0..80 Comment "//! The cancellation subject\'s shared declarations, written once and imported by"
81..161 Comment "//! every source that reads them (`import \"./cancel-base.gandr\";`): a task hands"
162..241 Comment "//! its parent what it found over its end. A cancellation point is an operation"
242..322 Comment "//! a capability scope answers; its clause resumes the rest of the scope once or"
323..386 Comment "//! abandons it, and an abandoned end is cancelled for its peer"
387..444 Comment "//! [Fowler-2019-exceptional_asynchronous_session_types]."
